    },
    {
      "id": "endpoint-anchor-landing",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Endpoint and Anchor Laboratory",
      "position": { "x": -220, "y": -420 },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "ports": [{ "id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 180 }],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": { "content": { "kind": "markdown", "value": "# Endpoint / Anchor Laboratory\n\nA **Port** is the durable semantic endpoint. A **Handle** is a rendered interaction anchor bound to that Port. This graph keeps those concerns visibly separate." }, "renderShape": { "kind": "markdown" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "endpoint-anchor-detail-view",
      "type": "view",
      "label": "Smoke Detail",
      "position": { "x": -220, "y": -40 },
      "width": 420,
      "height": 260,
      "ports": [{ "id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 180 }],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": { "view": { "intent": "node", "payload": "node.web.detail", "semanticLevel": "detail" }, "semanticLevel": "detail", "sourceScope": "graph", "sourceNodeId": "endpoint-anchor-landing", "sourcePayload": "content" }
    },
    {
      "id": "named-endpoint",
      "type": "port",
      "label": "1. Named Semantic Port",
      "position": { "x": 420, "y": -430 },
      "width": 330,
      "height": 210,
      "ports": [{ "id": "section-output", "key": "section-output", "label": "section output", "direction": "output", "dataType": "section", "angle": 0 }],
      "handles": [{ "id": "section-output-east", "key": "section-output-east", "portId": "section-output", "label": "section output", "direction": "output", "dataType": "section", "angle": 0 }],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": { "surfaceId": "section-output", "direction": "output", "dataType": "section", "smokeCase": "Explicit named Port remains the semantic endpoint." }
    },
    {
      "id": "implicit-root-target",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "2. Implicit Root Target",
      "position": { "x": 900, "y": -430 },
      "width": 330,
      "height": 210,
      "ports": [{ "id": "root", "key": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "input", "dataType": "any", "angle": 180 }],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": { "content": { "kind": "markdown", "value": "## Implicit root\n\nA node without an authored named endpoint remains connectable through `root`." }, "renderShape": { "kind": "markdown" }, "smokeCase": "Root fallback." }
    },
    {
      "id": "multi-anchor-port",
      "type": "port",
      "label": "3. One Port, Two Handles",
      "position": { "x": 420, "y": -80 },
      "width": 330,
      "height": 220,
      "ports": [{ "id": "result", "key": "result", "label": "result", "direction": "output", "dataType": "any", "angle": 0 }],
      "handles": [
        { "id": "result-left-anchor", "key": "result-left-anchor", "portId": "result", "label": "result", "direction": "output", "dataType": "any", "angle": 180 },
        { "id": "result-right-anchor", "key": "result-right-anchor", "portId": "result", "label": "result", "direction": "output", "dataType": "any", "angle": 0 }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": { "surfaceId": "result", "direction": "output", "dataType": "any", "smokeCase": "Two anchors bind to the same Port." }
    },
    {
      "id": "multi-anchor-target",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Shared Endpoint Target",
      "position": { "x": 900, "y": -80 },
      "width": 330,
      "height": 220,
      "ports": [{ "id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "input", "dataType": "any", "angle": 180 }],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": { "content": { "kind": "markdown", "value": "Both visual anchors should produce an edge whose semantic source remains `result`." }, "renderShape": { "kind": "markdown" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "hidden-handle-port",
      "type": "port",
      "label": "4. Hidden Handle, Live Port",
      "position": { "x": 420, "y": 270 },
      "width": 330,
      "height": 220,
      "ports": [{ "id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 0 }],
      "handles": [{ "id": "root-focus-anchor", "portId": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 0, "visible": false }],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": { "surfaceId": "hidden-handle", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "handleVisibility": "focused", "smokeCase": "Hiding the anchor must not delete root or its edge." }
    },
    {
      "id": "legacy-side-node",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "5. Legacy Side Handle",
      "position": { "x": 900, "y": 270 },
      "width": 330,
      "height": 220,
      "ports": [
        { "id": "top", "label": "top", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 90 },
        { "id": "right", "label": "right", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 0 },
        { "id": "bottom", "label": "bottom", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 270 },
        { "id": "left", "label": "left", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 180 }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": { "content": { "kind": "markdown", "value": "A legacy side endpoint means a same-named semantic Port only when explicitly declared. Otherwise it migrates to `root` plus that side as its anchor." }, "renderShape": { "kind": "markdown" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-edit-target",
      "type": "port",
      "label": "6. Edge Reassignment Target",
      "position": { "x": 900, "y": 620 },
      "width": 330,
      "height": 240,
      "ports": [
        { "id": "accept", "key": "accept", "label": "accept", "direction": "input", "dataType": "any", "angle": 180 },
        { "id": "alternate", "key": "alternate", "label": "alternate", "direction": "input", "dataType": "any", "angle": 0 }
      ],
      "handles": [
        { "id": "accept-left", "portId": "accept", "label": "accept", "direction": "input", "dataType": "any", "angle": 180 },
        { "id": "accept-top", "portId": "accept", "label": "accept", "direction": "input", "dataType": "any", "angle": 90 },
        { "id": "alternate-right", "portId": "alternate", "label": "alternate", "direction": "input", "dataType": "any", "angle": 0 }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": { "surfaceId": "edge-edit", "direction": "input", "dataType": "any", "smokeCase": "Move between accept anchors without semantic change; move to alternate for an explicit Port change." }
    },
    {
      "id": "endpoint-anchor-pass-procedure",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Pass Procedure",
      "position": { "x": -220, "y": 330 },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 500,
      "ports": [{ "id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 180 }],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": { "content": { "kind": "markdown", "value": "# Pass procedure\n\n1. Confirm the named `section-output` edge persists that semantic endpoint.\n2. Confirm an otherwise ordinary node remains connectable through `root`.\n3. Focus **One Port, Two Handles**. Both anchors must represent `result`; dragging either must not create two semantic Ports.\n4. Unfocus **Hidden Handle, Live Port**. Its handle may disappear, but its Port and edge must survive.\n5. Confirm the legacy `right` edge remains readable. Its migration interpretation is `root` with `right` as the visual anchor unless `right` is explicitly exposed semantically.\n6. Focus the edge entering **Edge Reassignment Target**. Move its endpoint from the left anchor to the top anchor: `targetPort` must remain `accept`. Move it to the right anchor: `targetPort` must become `alternate`.\n7. Save, reload, pan, and move nodes. Labels and anchors must remain attached to their handles, and every edge must retain its semantic endpoints.\n\n## Serialized contract\n\n`sourcePort` / `targetPort` identify meaning. `sourceAnchor` / `targetAnchor` identify drawing and interaction placement." }, "renderShape": { "kind": "markdown" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "endpoint-anchor-summary-view",
      "type": "view",
      "label": "Smoke Summary",
      "position": { "x": -600, "y": 120 },
      "width": 320,
      "height": 200,
      "ports": [{ "id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 0 }],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": { "view": { "intent": "node", "payload": "node.web.summary", "semanticLevel": "summary" }, "semanticLevel": "summary", "text": "Ports carry meaning. Handles place interaction." }
    },
    {
      "id": "endpoint-anchor-icon-view",
